      "id": "theme",
      "narration": "And it's organized around one recurring problem: an integration that worked beautifully in development now has to hold up in production. In development, the prompt looked solid, the tool call worked, sessions stayed short, and the inputs were manageable. Production is where longer sessions, larger tool outputs, interrupted streams, tighter cost constraints, and irreversible actions show up. Every topic in this module targets one of those failure modes, and teaches which implementation decision prevents it.",
      "elements": [
        { "id": "title", "kind": "handtext", "cue": "recurring problem", "text": "The build: dev → production", "size": 60, "color": "blue", "at": { "x": 120, "y": 90, "w": 1100, "h": 90 } },
