    {
      "id": "topics",
      "narration": "Eight topics, eight failure modes. Prompts that hold under inputs you never tested. Extended thinking, and when it earns its cost. Tool schemas that Claude selects correctly. Streaming you can recover when it breaks mid-response. Context engineering, to keep long sessions inside budget. Agent construction, with human checkpoints where actions can't be undone. Agent memory that survives across sessions. And finally, images, PDFs, and high-volume batch ingestion.",
